{"seq":5,"slug":"landscape-environment","title":"景观与环境设计","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment","rating":{"composite":3.65,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"景观与环境设计\">景观与环境设计</h1><p>景观与环境设计是一门融合自然科学、艺术美学与工程技术的综合性学科，研究人与自然环境之间的空间关系，通过对地形、植物、水体、构筑物等要素的系统组织，创造兼具生态功能、审美价值和社会意义的户外空间。从古典园林到当代生态基础设施，景观设计始终承载着人类对理想栖居环境的追求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-涵盖什么\">本 hub 涵盖什么</h2><p>本知识库从四个维度系统梳理景观与环境设计的核心知识体系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>「景观建筑学」——景观<a href=\"landscape-architecture/landscape-design-principles\">设计原则</a>、<a href=\"landscape-architecture/plant-design\">植物配置</a>与<a href=\"landscape-architecture/water-landscape\">水景设计</a>，奠定空间营造的语法。</li>\n<li>「生态设计」——<a href=\"ecological-design/landscape-ecology\">景观生态学</a>理论、<a href=\"ecological-design/green-infrastructure\">绿色基础设施</a>与<a href=\"ecological-design/ecological-restoration\">生态修复</a>，把景观从装饰提升为生态系统服务。</li>\n<li>「公共空间」——<a href=\"public-space/park-design\">公园与广场</a>、<a href=\"public-space/streetscape-design\">街道景观</a>与<a href=\"public-space/waterfront-design\">滨水空间</a>，关注城市开放空间的社会生活。</li>\n<li>「园林遗产」——<a href=\"garden-heritage/chinese-garden\">中国古典园林</a>、<a href=\"garden-heritage/western-garden-history\">西方园林史</a>与<a href=\"garden-heritage/contemporary-garden\">当代花园设计</a>，追溯造园艺术的历史脉络与当代演变。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-分工边界\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub：分工边界</h2><p>景观与环境是 53_architecture-urban 合集的一员，与若干兄弟 hub 主题相邻但分工明确：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>本 hub（景观与环境）负责</th>\n<th>交给兄弟 hub</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>城市尺度的开放空间与生态格局</td>\n<td>公园·街道·滨水的场地设计、生态网络落地</td>\n<td>用地·路网·分区等城市结构 → <a href=\"../urban-planning/\">城市规划</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可持续/能源</td>\n<td>绿色基础设施的生态系统服务</td>\n<td>建筑本体的净零·能耗 → <a href=\"../sustainable-net-zero-architecture/\">可持续与净零建筑</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>物理环境</td>\n<td>室外微气候·热岛·水文</td>\n<td>室内光热声·围护结构物理 → <a href=\"../building-physics-environment/\">建筑物理与环境</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>历史与遗产</td>\n<td>园林史·造园理论</td>\n<td>建筑风格史 → <a href=\"../architectural-history/\">建筑历史</a>；历史园林保护 → <a href=\"../heritage-conservation/\">遗产保护</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话：本 hub 处理「建筑之外、城市之间的户外空间」——地形、植物、水、生态过程与公共生活；建筑本体走<a href=\"../architectural-design/\">建筑设计</a>，城市骨架走<a href=\"../urban-planning/\">城市规划</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><p>建议先掌握「景观建筑学」的设计语法，再进入「生态设计」的系统视野，最后用「公共空间」落地、用「园林遗产」回望历史：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[景观建筑学&lt;br/&gt;原则·植物·水景] --&gt; B[生态设计&lt;br/&gt;生态学·GI·修复]&#10;    B --&gt; C[公共空间&lt;br/&gt;公园·街道·滨水]&#10;    A --&gt; D[园林遗产&lt;br/&gt;中/西/当代]&#10;    D -.历史互证.-&gt; A&#10;    C -.实践反哺.-&gt; B\">flowchart LR\n    A[景观建筑学&lt;br/&gt;原则·植物·水景] --&gt; B[生态设计&lt;br/&gt;生态学·GI·修复]\n    B --&gt; C[公共空间&lt;br/&gt;公园·街道·滨水]\n    A --&gt; D[园林遗产&lt;br/&gt;中/西/当代]\n    D -.历史互证.-&gt; A\n    C -.实践反哺.-&gt; B</pre><p>前置知识：阅读本 hub 不要求专业背景，但若已熟悉<a href=\"../architectural-design/\">建筑设计</a>的空间与尺度概念、<a href=\"../urban-planning/\">城市规划</a>的城市结构，将更易理解景观在建成环境中的定位。生态设计章节涉及基本的生态学与水文常识。</p>\n<h2 id=\"当代转型\">当代转型</h2><p>当代景观设计正经历深刻转型——从装饰性的绿化美化走向系统性的生态基础设施建设，从静态的空间营造走向动态的过程管理，从单一的审美追求走向多目标的综合效益。气候变化、生物多样性丧失和城市化加速，使得景观设计在应对全球环境挑战中扮演着越来越关键的角色。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landscape-architecture","title":"景观建筑学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/landscape-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landscape-design-principles","title":"景观设计原则 Landscape Design Principles","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/landscape-architecture/landscape-design-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plant-design","title":"植物设计与配置 Plant Design and Planting","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/landscape-architecture/plant-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"water-landscape","title":"水景与水系设计 Water Feature and Waterscape Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/landscape-architecture/water-landscape"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"ecological-design","title":"生态设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/ecological-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"landscape-ecology","title":"景观生态学 Landscape Ecology","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/ecological-design/landscape-ecology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"green-infrastructure","title":"绿色基础设施 Green Infrastructure","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/ecological-design/green-infrastructure"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecological-restoration","title":"生态修复设计 Ecological Restoration Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/ecological-design/ecological-restoration"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"public-space","title":"公共空间","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/public-space","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"park-design","title":"公园与广场设计 Park and Plaza Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/public-space/park-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"streetscape-design","title":"街道景观设计 Streetscape Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/public-space/streetscape-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"waterfront-design","title":"滨水空间设计 Waterfront Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/public-space/waterfront-design"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"garden-heritage","title":"园林遗产","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/garden-heritage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chinese-garden","title":"中国古典园林 Chinese Classical Garden","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/garden-heritage/chinese-garden"},{"seq":2,"slug":"western-garden-history","title":"西方园林史 Western Garden History","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/garden-heritage/western-garden-history"},{"seq":3,"slug":"contemporary-garden","title":"当代花园设计 Contemporary Garden Design","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/landscape-environment/garden-heritage/contemporary-garden"}]}]}